# Symbiote Spider-Man's Find New Host ({2}{U/B}, exile this card from your graveyard, sorcery speed): Entomb puts it into the graveyard, then Find New Host
# puts a +1/+1 counter on Memnite and gives it the other ability. Memnite (now 2/2) deals 2 combat damage on turn 3, so its controller looks at exactly
# two cards ("that many") and puts one into their hand and the other into the graveyard.

